    "text": "<div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1949\" target=\"_blank\">1949</a> – <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_II_(monkey)\" target=\"_blank\">Albert II</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhesus_monkey\" target=\"_blank\">rhesus monkey</a>, rides a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/V-2_rocket\" target=\"_blank\">V-2 rocket</a> to an altitude of 134&nbsp;km (83&nbsp;mi), thereby becoming the first mammal and first <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkeys_and_apes_in_space\" target=\"_blank\">monkey in space</a>.</div><div><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/spacepioneers0000park/mode/2up\" target=\"_blank\">📖Space pioneers by Steve Parker 2014</a></div>",
